 {
  "text": "Good morning, and welcome to the Miami Beach bus tour. On your right, there is Ocean Drive. On your left, there are many hotels and restaurants. The beach is very beautiful at sunset, at about six p.m. And this weekend, there is a free concert on the beach. Have a great weekend!",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a10_listening1.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Hi, Eliane! It is Rosa, from apartment 1206. This weekend there is a party at the pool, on Saturday at five. There is food, music and a beautiful sunset. My husband Tom is the cook! Are you and your husband free? See you on Saturday!",
